 "category": "Bass",
 "text": "Sound: the driving eighth-note octave bass of 80s synth-pop and new wave: low, high, low, high, a hollow pulse wave pumping under the song. It plays by itself.\n\nHow it's built: Clock 1/8 \u2192 Sequencer alternating the root and its octave \u2192 a pulse wave through the Ladder filter; a short envelope plucks filter and VCA. Hold a key around C3 and it plays from it.\n\nTweak: TEMPO, the step knobs (try a fifth, 7, on some), WIDTH, the envelope's DECAY, the filter's CUTOFF.",
